{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/f0e4cfb8eb513ec71ceef58b60c795ae.poster.avif?t=1767001050\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/f0e4cfb8eb513ec71ceef58b60c795ae.webm?t=1767001050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/f0e4cfb8eb513ec71ceef58b60c795ae.mp4?t=1767001050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab your local friend or use Steam Remote Play, build your robots with unique abilities, and prepare yourself for a shoot-out with evil robotic armies \u2014 All that while receiving both funny and enraging defects in four original episodes. Fall apart but do not fall back!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/b177c34751c721d8b54aad2104dae0fd.avif?t=1767001050\" width=780 height=241 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawlbot and Jetbot are different in terms of playstyle and <strong>customization options</strong>, but they complement each other. Despite being made from <strong>low-quality materials</strong>, and prone to <strong>malfunctions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/9df6c9debe5fa3cff7e1d3cf38c1e920.poster.avif?t=1767001050\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/9df6c9debe5fa3cff7e1d3cf38c1e920.webm?t=1767001050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/9df6c9debe5fa3cff7e1d3cf38c1e920.mp4?t=1767001050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/c1373b10979835689f14f89142dba79d.avif?t=1767001050\" width=780 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble unique robots from various <strong>defects and bonuses</strong>. Build a <strong>powerful but unstable</strong> robot or play it safe. Get more movement directions, active reload ability, power-ups, and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/e8729df275826be62f67eeffa12821b2.poster.avif?t=1767001050\" width=778 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/e8729df275826be62f67eeffa12821b2.webm?t=1767001050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/e8729df275826be62f67eeffa12821b2.mp4?t=1767001050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/22a3f5001ff288cc0388f7b245c45cb5.avif?t=1767001050\" width=780 height=241 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All bonuses need to be balanced out with faulty parts in a <strong>unique &quot;High risk - High reward&quot; customization</strong>. Can you turn the malfunctions into an advantage? Be prepared for  <strong>friendly fire</strong>, <strong>nonstop</strong> <strong>movement</strong>, or <strong>extra-thick smoke</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/58b0e94dcfdb83799069e542bb35c31a.poster.avif?t=1767001050\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/58b0e94dcfdb83799069e542bb35c31a.webm?t=1767001050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/58b0e94dcfdb83799069e542bb35c31a.mp4?t=1767001050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/ee9f23cf2890b7887708ff9393143070.avif?t=1767001050\" width=780 height=241 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through <strong>four episodes</strong>, each consisting of multiple missions designed to be <strong>played in one sitting</strong>, forming a short story. In every one of them, you meet different enemies, <strong>enjoy new mechanics,</strong> and experience various beautiful environments, all created and animated <strong>by hand</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/e4fbe6fdb604727d873e0d0272e7b310.poster.avif?t=1767001050\" width=780 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/e4fbe6fdb604727d873e0d0272e7b310.webm?t=1767001050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/e4fbe6fdb604727d873e0d0272e7b310.mp4?t=1767001050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/50d954d6f8d91c70f657b3da20ee3ffb.avif?t=1767001050\" width=780 height=241 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny, tinny mosh pit moves to the sound of the <strong>brass-heavy adaptive soundtrack</strong>. But you will be able to hum with our robots at the campfire too. Throw yourself to the tune of <strong>tubas, trombones, trumpets, and horns</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/0021294e6ef6e23f13591392940b9671.poster.avif?t=1767001050\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/0021294e6ef6e23f13591392940b9671.webm?t=1767001050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/0021294e6ef6e23f13591392940b9671.mp4?t=1767001050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/fe44a4f4641fb7b98a0e58dfe4509ba0.avif?t=1767001050\" width=780 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have chosen the most boring topic - bureaucracy -, added robots, and took it to an <strong>absurd extreme</strong>. But most fun still comes from <strong>your gameplay</strong>! Enemies stop at nothing. Except for the lunch break, there is <strong>no way</strong> they are going to miss that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/a2337c613661aa584b074e71bfda6d76.poster.avif?t=1767001050\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/a2337c613661aa584b074e71bfda6d76.webm?t=1767001050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172930/extras/a2337c613661aa584b074e71bfda6d76.mp4?t=1767001050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">BECOME A SILICOMRADE AND HELP SAVE INNOCENT LOW-COST ROBOTS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"a26a6b17ecde233393fd1d2d08f392a3d232e3c4.jpg","localized_name":"Glimpse of something awesome","name":"Glimpse of something awesome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1172930/a26a6b17ecde233393fd1d2d08f392a3d232e3c4.jpg"},{"icon":"a26a6b17ecde233393fd1d2d08f392a3d232e3c4.jpg","localized_name":"Samizdat distributor","name":"Samizdat distributor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1172930/a26a6b17ecde233393fd1d2d08f392a3d232e3c4.jpg"},{"icon":"a26a6b17ecde233393fd1d2d08f392a3d232e3c4.jpg","localized_name":"Uncensored","name":"Uncensored","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1172930/a26a6b17ecde233393fd1d2d08f392a3d232e3c4.jpg"},{"icon":"a26a6b17ecde233393fd1d2d08f392a3d232e3c4.jpg","localized_name":"Employees of the month","name":"Employees of the month","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1172930/a26a6b17ecde233393fd1d2d08f392a3d232e3c4.jpg"},{"icon":"a26a6b17ecde233393fd1d2d08f392a3d232e3c4.jpg","localized_name":"Employees of the year","name":"Employees of the year","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1172930/a26a6b17ecde233393fd1d2d08f392a3d232e3c4.jpg"},{"icon":"bacdd22497dd2d683e16e0db71ebc99f788cf720.jpg","localized_name":"True art is an explosion","name":"True art is an explosion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcom